                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae Megatron LM. To protect your system, clone or update this software to version 0.12.2 or later from <a href=\"https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/releases\">Releases \u00b7 NVIDIA/Megatron-LM on GitHub</a>.",
